  "description": "Konvo DM/messaging health: WS connections, envelope routing rate by routerType, envelope persist+publish latency (p50/p95/p99 per Requirement 18.2), offline-queued envelopes, and rate-limit rejections. Authored in task 10.2; metrics emitted from apps/api/src/obs/metrics.ts.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
